Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:17:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drawer: master On/Off switch for the app drawer
 (inkOS-Patcher)

Adds Settings > App Drawer > "Enable App Drawer" (default On). When Off,
everything that opens the drawer to browse apps does nothing:
- the "App Drawer" action on any gesture, shortcut icon or key mapping
- the Menu key and Backspace on Home
- the "App Drawer" home shortcut and the OPEN_APP_DRAWER intent

The Search action and typing on Home still open search. Settings and the
home-app, favorites and hidden-app pickers are unchanged. Logic lives in
ui/AppDrawerToggle.kt; upstream files get one-line hooks only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
